      <h1>DC Motor Speed: System Analysis</h1>
      <!--introduction-->
	        <p>Key MATLAB commands used in this tutorial are: <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/tf.html"><tt>tf</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/control/ref/linearsystemanalyzer-app.html"><tt>linearSystemAnalyzer</tt></a></p>
      <a href="https://www.mathworks.com/campaigns/products/control-tutorials.html#dc-motor-speed-system-analysis" style="color: white" class="button"> Run Live Script Version in MATLAB Online</a>
	  </div>
	<div class="related_links">
      <h3>Related Tutorial Links</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="?example=Introduction&section=SystemAnalysis">System Analysis Intro</a></li>
		<li><a href="?aux=Activities_DCmotorA">DC Motor Activity</a></li>
      </ul>
	  <h3>Related External Links</h3>
      <ul>
	    <li><a href="https://www.mathworks.com/academia/student_center/tutorials/source/controls/System_Analysis/player.html">Analysis in MATLAB Video</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F4w0rslb04E">Time Resp Video</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://youtu.be/tES6_mOoH8s?t=2m46s">Model Reduction Video</a></li>
